  "translatedBlocks": 12,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a71549f452f6755",
      "translationZh": "我在过去的几周里进行了一个业余研究项目，刚刚将其公开。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f6c1e04453555199",
      "translationZh": "这个想法并不新鲜（产品键记忆、Lample等人2019年以及Meta的“大规模记忆层”）：给模型一个巨大的学习向量表，并让它每个令牌只读取其中几百个。我想知道这在小型模型上实际值多少，成本多少，以及该表是否必须驻留在VRAM中。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "3ccd51aa5ce87c2c",
      "translationZh": "一个带有16.8M行表的21M模型（表中包含6.4B参数，每个令牌使用33M）与在相同的500M维基百科令牌上训练的114M密集模型一样好。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "22a049cab001009e",
      "translationZh": "该表不需要VRAM。使用从NVMe SSD内存映射的4位表，该模型在我的RX 9070上仍然以~140 tok/s的速度写入，使用0.4 GB的VRAM。不过，从SSD读取长提示词很慢，每次错过一行都要花费整整4 KB页面。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "043a5178fdf950eb",
      "translationZh": "我为此编写了Triton内核。它们在我的Radeon、MI350X和H100/H200上无需更改即可运行。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "38f3d8b7c6bea178",
      "translationZh": "将表附加到完成的模型（Qwen3.5-0.8B）上不起作用：与具有相同计算量的一个小型密集附加组件相比没有更好的效果。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "decbcbbbad8ac8b2",
      "translationZh": "注意事项：它很小，大运行只有一个种子，它写的文本是流畅的维基百科英语，包含编造的事实。我在每次运行前都写下了成功标准，不起作用的东西也在里面。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0696bb20076de1d8",
      "translationZh": "大部分运行在我的游戏PC上，大运行在Runpod上花费约70美元。我与Claude Code一起构建了它（你会在提交记录中看到它），想法、决策和资金都是我的。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "888d5352e1be9f96",
      "translationZh": "仓库：https://github.com/re133/sparse-memory-lm",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "03feeffb527a5c23",
      "translationZh": "点击一个单词并查看模型读取了哪些表条目：https://re133.github.io/sparse-memory-lm/explorer/",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc184cee29d96ca0",
      "translationZh": "模型：https://huggingface.co/fechyy/sparse-memory-lm-B-16M",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1bb862d803b2569d",
      "translationZh": "欢迎反馈，尤其是如果我搞错了。如果有人有多余的 GPU，我很想在 1B 规模下尝试这个。",
      "provider": "bigmodel",
      "model": "glm-4.7-flash"
    }
  ],
